   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Only a reply with the right MAC (the shared key, over this check-in's nonce) is acted on, and the device still installs\nonly firmware signed with your key. Releases are never retried in a loop: an update ends as done, rolled back, refused,\nfailed (3 broken downloads) or lost (no report in 2 hours). The site cannot reach a device: there is no \"update now\".",
   "originalText": "Only a reply with the right MAC (the shared key, over this check-in's nonce) is acted on, and the device still installs\nonly firmware signed with your key. Releases are never retried in a loop: an update ends as done, rolled back, refused,\nfailed (3 broken downloads) or lost (no report in 2 hours). The site cannot reach a device: there is no \"update now\".",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
